      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَأَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَاَ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجْءٌ</span> (so in the
